  "legalOwnerReview": "Draft wording — to be confirmed by Melai Nuts.",
  "legalSection": "LEGAL",
  "legalTermsSubtitle": "Rules for using the app",
  "legalPrivacySubtitle": "What data we collect and your rights",
  "termsS1Title": "1. What this app does",
  "termsS1Body": "Melai Nuts lets you browse products, order from a Melai Nuts branch for pickup at the counter, track your orders, request refunds and earn loyalty points. Staff and owners use the same app for the shop counter and stock.",
  "termsS2Title": "2. Your account",
  "termsS2Body": "Give your real name, a working email and a mobile number you own. Keep your password secret and do not share your account. You are responsible for what is done with your account. Tell a branch right away if you think someone else is using it. We may deactivate an account that breaks these terms.",
  "termsS3Title": "3. Orders and payment",
  "termsS3Body": "Prices, stock and discounts are checked by our system when you place the order; the total on your confirmation is the amount you pay. Orders are for pickup at the branch counter. When online payment is on, you pay a 30% downpayment online through HitPay (GCash, QR Ph or card) and the rest in cash when you pick up. When online payment is off, you pay the full amount in cash at pickup. An order may be cancelled if an item runs out; you are not charged for cancelled items.",
  "termsS4Title": "4. Refunds",
  "termsS4Body": "You can ask for a refund in the app, with a reason, within 7 days after you pick up your order. The branch reviews each request. The refund amount is computed by the system from the items you return, not typed in by anyone. Approved refunds are paid back in cash at the branch or to the original payment method.",
  "termsS5Title": "5. Loyalty points",
  "termsS5Body": "You earn points when an order is completed. Points from an order that is refunded are taken back. Points have no cash value, cannot be transferred to another person and are used only for rewards in this app. Melai Nuts may change the earning and reward rules; changes are shown in the app before they apply.",
  "termsS6Title": "6. Pickup and downpayment",
  "termsS6Body": "• Pay the downpayment within 30 minutes of placing the order. If it is not paid in time, the order is cancelled and nothing is charged.\n• Pick up your order within 2 days after it is marked \"Ready for Pickup\". If you do not pick it up in time, the order is cancelled and the shop keeps the downpayment.\n• If the order is cancelled for any other reason, including by the shop, your downpayment is refunded in full to the payment method you used.\n• Pay the balance in cash at the counter when you pick up.",
  "termsS7Title": "7. Acceptable use",
  "termsS7Body": "Do not place orders you do not mean to pay for or collect, guess voucher codes, copy the catalog with automated tools, try to get around the app's security, or use another person's account. The app limits repeated attempts to protect every customer.",
  "termsS8Title": "8. Changes to these terms",
  "termsS8Body": "When these terms or the Privacy Policy change, the app shows the new version and asks you to accept it again before you continue.",
  "termsS9Title": "9. Contact",
  "termsS9Body": "For questions about your account, an order or these terms, contact any Melai Nuts branch. Branch phone numbers are listed in the app under Settings > Branch Settings.",
  "privacyS1Title": "1. Who is responsible for your data",
  "privacyS1Body": "Melai Nuts Retailing is the personal information controller for the data in this app, as defined by the Philippine Data Privacy Act of 2012 (Republic Act No. 10173). Our Data Protection Officer is the owner of Melai Nuts Retailing, reachable at melaioraya5@gmail.com.",
  "privacyS2Title": "2. Data we collect",
  "privacyS2Body": "• Your name, email address and mobile number.\n• Your orders, payments, refunds and loyalty points.\n• Your phone's location, used on your phone to choose the nearest open branch. We save only the branch, not your location.\n• A notification token so we can send order updates to this phone.\n• Crash reports, which carry an account ID but not your name, email or phone.",
  "privacyS3Title": "3. How we use it",
  "privacyS3Body": "To create your account, prepare and deliver your orders, take payment, handle refunds, keep your loyalty points, send the updates you chose, keep the app secure, and fix problems. We do not sell your data.",
  "privacyS4Title": "4. Where it is stored and who can see it",
  "privacyS4Body": "Sign-in is handled by Firebase (Google). Business data is stored in our Supabase database. Online payments are handled by HitPay. We receive the payment status and amount, not your card or GCash details. A copy of recent data is kept on your phone so the app works offline; it is erased when you sign out. Staff see only what their branch needs.",
  "privacyS5Title": "5. How long we keep it",
  "privacyS5Body": "Orders, payments and refunds are kept for 5 years for tax and accounting records. Account details are kept while your account is active and are deleted within 30 days of a deletion request, except records we must keep by law.",
  "privacyS6Title": "6. Your rights (RA 10173)",
  "privacyS6Body": "You have the right to be informed, to access your data, to object, to have it corrected, to have it erased or blocked, to data portability, to claim damages, and to file a complaint with the National Privacy Commission (privacy.gov.ph).",
  "privacyS7Title": "7. Deleting your data",
  "privacyS7Body": "To ask for a copy of your data, to have your account deleted, or with any other privacy question, email melaioraya5@gmail.com. Account details are deleted within 30 days of the request. Records the law requires us to keep (for example, receipts) are kept but no longer linked to your profile where possible.",
  "privacyS8Title": "8. Permissions on your phone",
  "privacyS8Body": "The app asks for the camera (scan barcodes), location (find your nearest branch) and notifications (order updates) only when you use that feature. You can change them any time in Settings > Permissions.",
